{"id": "tea:bhaktirasabodhini:mira", "source": "src:bhaktirasabodhini", "location": {"ref": "kavitts on Mīrā"}, "paraphrase": "Priyādās tells how the Rāṇā sent Mīrā poison, which she drank as Kṛṣṇa's prasād and which turned to nectar; a snake sent in a basket became a śāligrāma; in Vṛndāvana, told that Jīva Gosvāmī would not meet women, she asked whether there was any male in Vraja besides Kṛṣṇa.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "devotional", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["narrative", "powers-experiences"], "teachers": ["tch:priyadas", "tch:mirabai"], "obstacles": ["obs:loka-lajja"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U26-regional-bhakti"], "disagreements": []}, "coverage": ["A9"], "notes": "Tradition's account.", "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U26-regional-bhakti"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:bhaktirasabodhini:tulsi", "source": "src:bhaktirasabodhini", "location": {"ref": "kavitts on Tulsīdās"}, "paraphrase": "Rebuked by his wife that love for Rāma would save him as love for her could not, Tulsī renounced; a ghost he had watered told him how to meet Hanumān, who attends every telling of the Rāma story in disguise, and Hanumān promised him the vision of Rāma at Citrakūṭa.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "devotional", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["narrative", "teacher-transmission"], "teachers": ["tch:priyadas", "tch:tulsidas"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U26-regional-bhakti"], "disagreements": []}, "coverage": ["A9"], "notes": "Tradition's account.", "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U26-regional-bhakti"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
